notes.content:
- the quality of shadows, lighting, some textures was improved, color correction was changed, and more, the game began to look nicer and brighter;

- productivity increased by ~ 10%;

- added tips;

- fixed localization errors;

- the interior of some premises has been improved;

- added some new interesting places for research;

- added some new easter eggs;

- added more loot;

- fixed bug with damage from rifle, glock and ax, enemies began to move faster;

A network mode is being developed and a single game is being finalized.

What's new:
- Portuguese;
- the location became snowy, the atmosphere of the new year was added (trees, garlands, snowmen ...);
- prologue removed;
- corrected settings, changed the appearance of the settings menu;
- the plot is corrected;
- added Mars location;
- Now the storyline can be passed;
- Fixed Spanish translation;
- fuel filling into cans and quad bikes was accelerated;
- accelerated sleep protagonist;
- slightly modified a couple of interface details;
- fixed inventory bug;
- added some crafting recipes;
- the game sometimes did not start through the Steam client - the error was fixed;
- fixed the system save bug;
- Added a base of aliens with a portal to Mars;
- slightly modified environment;
- the game is optimized by 5-10%;
- Fixed a bug with adjusting the sound volume.

It is planned to add cards, but so far Steam does not allow this to be done.

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/32805016/820cb612b87b5dde95f78fb6ffd2a4e0dadd34f7.jpg[/img]

- Added Halloween atmosphere;

- Added new lighting;

- Added a new system for changing the time of day, new, more realistic clouds, sounds of the environment, rain, snow, thunder and thunder;

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/32805016/8c6789e132a36dde849a000b32713a5ba7a377c2.jpg[/img]

- fixed all the errors with the time in the game, with a wristwatch;

- fixed some errors in the movement of the character;

- in some places, lamps, chandeliers and lamps were added, which turned dark places into well-lit ones;

- Fixed many different bugs;

At the moment we are doing: the plot, some quests were meaningless and irrelevant - we remove them, add new quests, finalize the alien laboratory, quests leading to the journey to Mars (the Mars location is currently at the initial stage of development, but the work is already coming) We are planning to develop a separate setting on Mars, which should please you, at the same time the player will be able to return from Mars to Earth, but this is not certain ...

The main character will become more talkative, now we are agreeing to record new soundtracks with the replicas of main character, so we will be able to revive the game world even more.

Before finalizing the story, we decided to remake the world, the map will become slightly smaller, but much richer, more picturesque, and more realistic.

If all that we have planned is fully realized - When They Arrived will be a completely different game, the way we originally saw it.

- Added a new game mode: "Farm Defense".

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/32805016/11bb32e00219be38471fdc0eda90739b83ee42db.jpg[/img]
[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/32805016/ffe244b3eaafedffc3f1713a1e0ba353beb5b533.jpg[/img]

- Added new crafting recipes;

- Added new traps;

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/32805016/69320003fbadae31971d86cb4513e51751299cbb.jpg[/img]

- The game world is improved, added more loot;

- in the process - arrangement of the settlement Brightwood (new buildings are added, filled with loot, etc.);

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/32805016/6a1eb38dd109e691d611153660642272dc7e96b6.jpg[/img]
[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/32805016/07917b8340b3e698ea1b64a27f54966872fa3a71.jpg[/img]

- fixed bugs in the sound settings, the sound in the game has become more balanced;

- Added Spanish localization;

- added more places where you can find shelter, sleep, warm up and find provisions;

- Fixed many flaws in the menu sections (the buttons overlapped each other);

- Now some windows are closed when you press Esc;

- fixed bugs with doors, now almost all doors in the game can be opened / closed;

- the aliens are being finalized, soon they will be added weapons that can be used by the player;

- Work is underway on the ability to create various shields and body armor;

- new traps are being developed, soon will be added: crossbow-machine gun, falling wall with spikes and others;

- fixed clock bug, time is displayed correctly;

- fixed bugs in the sleep panel;

- alcohol now raises the level of health, and raises thirst;

- fixed bugs with bandages, some buildings, traps and other objects (earlier, after use, they were not removed from the inventory);

- AI mutants become more balanced.

At the moment we are preparing for Halloween, thematic elements of the holiday will be added to the game, which will give a creepy atmosphere and diversify the gameplay. In parallel with the preparation for the holiday - we are engaged in the online mode, the plot (since 40% of the plot has not yet been added to the game), the new game mode - “ATV Rally”, and the overall refinement of the game.

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/32805016/292784391d9ecd43e6cf9c2856b4e43cc7de7b83.png[/img]

- added hours, showing the time in the game;
- Added the ability to build and destroy a variety of buildings;
- added a map of the terrain, you need to find all of its fragments, so that it is displayed in full;
- added a new system for saving and loading loot items and your buildings (now all the changes you made to the game will be saved by 100%);
- fixed bugs with endless meat and bonfire;
- The sound is corrected, something became louder, something is quieter;
- Added new tips;
- fixed some errors in the plot, and some syntax errors;
- added new crafting recipes;
- Added more places where the protagonist can sleep;
- The sleep system is fixed;
- added several new loot items.

- Added new tips;
- Performance has been optimized by 20%;
- Improved system of saving and loading the game;
- extraction of ores is added;
- A new inventory was added;
- added a compass and a map;
- a new system of crafting and recipes;
- improved suspension and lighting of the ATV lantern;
- Improved AI UFO, changed the appearance of UFOs;
- Development of a small village has begun, new residential buildings have been added;
- Added new types of weapons;
- Now you can get wood in two ways - to cut a tree with an ax, saw a tree in a sawmill;
- Fixed bugs in the removal of ammunition;

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/32805016/4ff73df4f13fa3c82d5f646199aacaa1bf89ca31.jpg[/img]

What's new:

- fixed some errors in the story;

- improved lighting, rays from the sun;

- the length of the day is doubled;

- Fixed a bright night sky;

- Now the game supports any resolution that supports your monitor and video card;

- selection of notes and newspapers is arranged;

- Improved balancing of the ATV, the engine stalls and does not start when the gasoline ends;

- earlier it was impossible to kill aliens and wild boars - the problem is fixed;

- the volume of the ATV, rifles, and mutants - became quieter;

- Anabel doll was added, and some paranormal phenomena associated with it;

- changed the appearance and functionality of the hints, now they do not interfere with the play;

- fixed a bug in the sleep panel (you could not sleep more than 1 hour);

- The rifle is balanced;

- there will be more mutants and it will be more difficult to kill them;

- the opportunity to kindle a fire in the house is added;

- thirst, hunger and temperature of the environment are balanced;

- added a slider to the generator and a balanced burning of gasoline;

- new sounds of the environment, night and day;

- added a sight-pointer to the center of the screen;

We are working on the story, the main gameplay elements, the network mode, new inventory, craft system and buildings.
